      <activity id="7d9a1108-146d-5535-acd7-125dfd4059f9" activityNameId="0d01db7a-b426-5be5-9daa-4e6364600f65" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Barley seed IP, at regional storehouse</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Barley seed IP, at regional storehouse
Refers to 1 kg of barley seed (fresh weight), with a maximum water content of 15%;
UUID: 97d5d65e-7e57-301c-a6a2-d68f40167281
The seed produced at the farm is transported to the processing centre, treated (pre-cleaning, cleaning, eventually drying, chemical dressing (for integrated production) and bag filling), stored and afterwards transported to the regional storage centre. No data on wastewater production were available. 
Location: undefined
Technology: Refers to average seed processing
Time period: Date of the major data sources.
Production volume: Consumption of barley seed in Switzerland is 7133t/year, 1% imported
Sampling: Data based on a literature, expert information and enquiry of seed processing plants. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_97d5d65e-7e57-301c-a6a2-d68f40167281.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
